OL,3,GNEWSA'A stroke aged 43 changed my sense
OL,4,Aof who I was'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The stroke didn't just change my body.
OL,7,FIt changed my mind, my confidence, my
OL,8,Fsense of who I was."
OL,10,FDarren Dickenson from Headington, in
OL,11,FOxford, had just become a granddad in
OL,12,FOctober 2024 when, at the age of 43, he
OL,13,Fsuffered a stroke while at home.
OL,15,FHe was forced to undergo life-saving
OL,16,Femergency surgery, before complications
OL,17,Ffollowed - leading to a lengthy
OL,18,Frecovery.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
