OL,3,GNEWSA'A stroke aged 43 changed my sense
OL,4,Aof who I was'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDickenson and his wife Sophie are now
OL,7,Fsharing their story as part of a new
OL,8,Fcampaign by The Stroke Association
OL,9,Fcalled Survival is Not Enough.
